Package: MDPL
Title: Multi-Source Data Fusion via Power Likelihoods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Xi", "Lin", , "xi.lin@stats.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Robin", "Evans", , "evans@stats.ox.ac.uk", role = "aut"))
Description: Combines a randomised trial with one or several observational
    data sources through power likelihoods. The weight given to each source is
    chosen from the trial data itself, so that biased sources are down-weighted.
    Works with generalised linear models, with copula-based frugal models from
    the 'causl' package, and with user-supplied smooth likelihoods, and
    returns conditional and average treatment effects with bootstrap intervals.
